        "content": "## US Federal GovCon (SAM.gov) Daily B2B Lead Scraper + SEC & EPA Due Diligence (3-Actor Cascade)\n\nMonitors active US federal contract solicitations on SAM.gov every morning at 07:00 AM, enriches prime contractors with SEC EDGAR 10-K/8-K/Form 4 filings and EPA compliance history, and routes high-intent B2B opportunities to CRM.\n\n### Multi-Actor Cascade Powered by Apify Store (`@b2b-quant-apis`):\n- [`b2b-quant-apis/us-sam-gov-federal-procurement-auditor`](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/us-sam-gov-federal-procurement-auditor)\n- [`b2b-quant-apis/us-sec-edgar-filings-insider-radar`](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/us-sec-edgar-filings-insider-radar)\n- [`b2b-quant-apis/us-epa-echo-environmental-compliance-auditor`](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/us-epa-echo-environmental-compliance-auditor)\n\n**Setup:** Configure a single `httpHeaderAuth` credential (`Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`) across the Apify HTTP Request nodes and activate the Schedule Trigger.",
